{"4160870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Echoes of the Rest", "steam_appid": 4160870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Echoes Lie</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person psychological horror game where you explore a haunted house, uncover memories, and face the consequences of Joe’s guilt and fading sanity. Every sound hides a lie. Every choice changes his fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person psychological horror experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, interact, and uncover hidden memories within the house.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape Joe’s fate and the story’s ending.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160870/extras/bcfdaf9bf179f3a3b868b5d2589b21b2.poster.avif?t=1769709518\" width=716 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160870/extras/bcfdaf9bf179f3a3b868b5d2589b21b2.webm?t=1769709518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160870/extras/bcfdaf9bf179f3a3b868b5d2589b21b2.mp4?t=1769709518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTHING IS THE SAME AFTER THE ACCIDENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relive Jo’s fractured mind and face the truth buried in his past.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The line between memory and madness fades with every step.</strong></p></li></ul><p class